  "description": "Seo-Jin, a kind florist, finds himself thrown into events that span worlds and time when he rescues a mysterious man named Harold... a man he's seen before, in dreams. Fueled by burning curiosity and an addictive attraction, they will face the dark powers moving against them to seek answers. How did Harold end up in this world? Why does Seo-Jin look like Harold’s lost love, Helio? And can they find a way to be together in the face of their impossible odds?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
